// The project's general markdownlint configuration.
//
// MD043 is absent from this file and must stay absent, at every value
// including false: markdownlint-cli2 merges this file over the base given by
// --config, so a mention here would disable the spec and decision-record
// heading shapes while their hooks kept reporting success.
//
// MD013 is off because line wrapping is owned by the formatter, not the
// linter, and a second opinion about column width only produces noise.
{
  "config": {
    "MD013": false
  }
}
